002Fmailer","de\u002F3.user-guides\u002F6.mailer",{"title":150,"path":151,"stem":152},"Einstellungen","\u002Fde\u002Fuser-guides\u002Fsettings","de\u002F3.user-guides\u002F7.settings",{"title":154,"path":155,"stem":156},"Sprachen (i18n)","\u002Fde\u002Fuser-guides\u002Fi18n","de\u002F3.user-guides\u002F8.i18n",{"title":158,"path":159,"stem":160},"iOS-App","\u002Fde\u002Fuser-guides\u002Fios-app","de\u002F3.user-guides\u002F9.ios-app",{"title":162,"path":163,"stem":164,"children":165},"Entwicklung","\u002Fde\u002Fdevelopment","de\u002F8.development\u002F1.index",[166,167,171],{"title":162,"path":163,"stem":164},{"title":168,"path":169,"stem":170},"User Activity","\u002Fde\u002Fdevelopment\u002Fuser-activity","de\u002F8.development\u002F5.user-activity",{"title":154,"path":172,"stem":173},"\u002Fde\u002Fdevelopment\u002Fi18n","de\u002F8.development\u002Fi18n",{"title":175,"path":176,"stem":177,"children":178},"Design","\u002Fde\u002Fdesign","de\u002F9.design\u002F1.index",[179],{"title":175,"path":176,"stem":177},{"id":181,"title":40,"body":182,"description":188,"extension":325,"links":326,"meta":327,"navigation":328,"path":329,"redirect":326,"seo":330,"stem":331,"__hash__":332},"content_en\u002F1.getting-started\u002F4.installation\u002F2.cloud.md",{"type":183,"value":184,"toc":315},"minimark",[185,189,192,197,226,230,241,244,248,263,267,308,312],[186,187,188],"p",{},"FiveNet Cloud is available today as a managed hosting option for communities that want us to run and maintain FiveNet for them.",[186,190,191],{},"The service is hosted by ZerBytes UG (haftungsbeschrankt).",[193,194,196],"h3",{"id":195},"why-choose-fivenet-cloud","Why Choose FiveNet Cloud",[198,199,200,208,214,220],"ul",{},[201,202,203,207],"li",{},[204,205,206],"strong",{},"Managed Hosting",": We run and maintain your FiveNet instance for you.",[201,209,210,213],{},[204,211,212],{},"Less Operational Overhead",": You do not need to build and maintain your own Docker or Kubernetes setup for FiveNet.",[201,215,216,219],{},[204,217,218],{},"Ongoing Updates",": We keep your FiveNet instance up to date as new releases become available.",[201,221,222,225],{},[204,223,224],{},"Direct Support",": Cloud customers can reach out through Discord support tickets for onboarding and operational questions.",[193,227,229],{"id":228},"what-you-still-need-to-provide","What You Still Need To Provide",[198,231,232,235,238],{},[201,233,234],{},"Access to the gameserver database that FiveNet should use.",[201,236,237],{},"The required plugin integration on your gameserver.",[201,239,240],{},"Any server-specific configuration needed for your community and framework.",[186,242,243],{},"FiveNet Cloud reduces the infrastructure work on your side, but you still need to connect it to your gameserver environment.",[193,245,247],{"id":246},"getting-started","Getting Started",[249,250,251,254,257,260],"ol",{},[201,252,253],{},"Join the FiveNet Discord.",[201,255,256],{},"Create a support ticket for FiveNet Cloud.",[201,258,259],{},"Share the details needed for your setup, such as your community, gameserver environment, and database connectivity.",[201,261,262],{},"We will guide you through onboarding and the remaining setup steps.",[193,264,266],{"id":265},"faqs","FAQs",[268,269,272,280,287,294,301],"card-group",{"className":270},[271],"sm:grid-cols-1",[273,274,277],"card",{"icon":275,"title":276},"i-mdi-database","What happens to my data?",[186,278,279],{},"Your gameserver database must be accessible to FiveNet. If you later switch to a self-hosted instance, you can request the attachment data, such as avatars.",[273,281,284],{"icon":282,"title":283},"i-mdi-currency-usd-off","Is there a free tier?",[186,285,286],{},"Currently, there is no free tier available for FiveNet.",[273,288,291],{"icon":289,"title":290},"i-mdi-cloud-upload","How do I migrate from self-hosted to cloud?",[186,292,293],{},"No full migration is required. Since your FiveNet data, such as citizens and documents, remains tied to your database, the main extra step is handling attachment data if needed.",[273,295,298],{"icon":296,"title":297},"i-mdi-cloud-download","How do I migrate from cloud to self-hosted?",[186,299,300],{},"Since FiveNet data, such as citizens and documents, is stored in your database, you mainly need a copy of the attachment data for your self-hosted instance. The FiveNet Cloud team can assist with this process.",[273,302,305],{"icon":303,"title":304},"i-mdi-tools","Do I still need technical setup on my side?",[186,306,307],{},"Yes. FiveNet Cloud removes most of the infrastructure work, but you still need to provide database access and complete the required plugin integration for your gameserver.",[193,309,311],{"id":310},"next-step","Next Step",[186,313,314],{},"Join the FiveNet Discord and create a cloud support ticket to get started with FiveNet Cloud. Our team can help with onboarding, setup questions, and migration planning.",{"title":316,"searchDepth":317,"depth":317,"links":318},"",2,[319,321,322,323,324],{"id":195,"depth":320,"text":196},3,{"id":228,"depth":320,"text":229},{"id":246,"depth":320,"text":247},{"id":265,"depth":320,"text":266},{"id":310,"depth":320,"text":311},"md",null,{},true,"\u002Fgetting-started\u002Finstallation\u002Fcloud",{"title":40,"description":188},"1.getting-started\u002F4.installation\u002F2.cloud","M84Q8MCY-jjvqNEWXcEl1kSYvi5-yQioBd4sxSzDUHY",[334,339],{"title":335,"path":336,"stem":337,"description":338,"children":-1},"Installation Methods","\u002Fgetting-started\u002Finstallation\u002Fmethods","1.getting-started\u002F4.installation\u002F1.methods","Choose the installation path that fits your environment, whether you want managed hosting with FiveNet Cloud or a self-hosted deployment with Docker or Kubernetes.",{"title":340,"path":341,"stem":342,"description":343,"children":-1},"Using Docker","\u002Fgetting-started\u002Finstallation\u002Fcontainer-docker","1.getting-started\u002F4.installation\u002F3.container-docker","Deploy FiveNet with Docker Engine and the Docker Compose plugin on a single server.",1787913103858]